==Russian==

===Prefix===
'''под-''', {{lang|ru|[[подо-]]}} (pod-, podo-)

# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[upwards]] {{gloss|describing an action of moving from the bottom up; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[бро́сить]]|''(pf.)'' to throw|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подбро́сить]]|''(pf.)'' to throw upwards|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[closer]] {{gloss|describing an action of approaching to an entity; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[идти́]]|''(impf.)'' to go (by walking)|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подойти́]]|''(pf.)'' to walk up to, to approach (by walking)|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[closer]] {{gloss|describing an action of adding more entity; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|бавить|an archaic [[causative]] form of [[быть]] that depends on verbal prefixes in contemporary usage|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подба́вить]]|''(pf.)'' to add, replenish|inline=y}}
# {{context|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[under]]
#:* {{l|ru|писа́ть}} — ''to write''
#:* {{l|ru|подписывать|подписа́ть}} — ''to sign, to subscribe''
# place names
#:* {{l|ru|Подкарпатье}} — ''Subcarpathia''

====Usage notes====
* In the meaning of ''closer'', only use под- when the subject is in the sight range of the object of interest, and then moves even closer towards it.
: ''Я подошла к памятнику.''
::I walked up to the statue. (I already was in the same room or space with it, and then walked closer to it.)
: ''Я {{lang|ru|[[прийти|пришла]]}} к памятнику.''
::I arrived at the statue. (I came to the statue from somewhere further.)

